WEBVTT

00:05:58.555 --> 00:06:00.547
nigeuke na kuangalia makalio yake?

00:06:01.531 --> 00:06:02.761
Hiyo imetokea wapi?

00:06:03.864 --> 00:06:07.102
Kama nisipouliza hilo,
nitafuata tu mkumbo.

00:06:09.706 --> 00:06:11.540
Misemo ya chumba
cha kubadilisha.

00:06:11.896 --> 00:06:14.849
Kwenye duara, tunakaa
na kuuliza haya mambo.

00:06:14.873 --> 00:06:16.741
Kwanini ninafikiri jinsi ninavyofikiri?

00:06:16.765 --> 00:06:18.585
Kwanini ninatenda jinsi ninavyotenda?

00:06:19.087 --> 00:06:21.626
Kwa sababu ninapoangalia kwa umakini,
sifikirii,

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.910
siwi kama mtu binafsi,

00:06:23.934 --> 00:06:26.576
sichukui wajibu wa mimi ni nani

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:28.713
na ni nini ninachoweka kwenye hii dunia.